well-known open source

00:30:01.290 --> 00:30:03.593
storage and database products.

00:30:03.593 --> 00:30:05.010
And we're looking
at more and more

00:30:05.010 --> 00:30:07.510
to make that managed
experience easier

00:30:07.510 --> 00:30:08.760
for you to run multiple calls.

00:30:11.445 --> 00:30:13.570
AUDIENCE: OK, that might
