00:31:15.860 --> 00:31:19.002
specifically,
considering the market.

00:31:19.002 --> 00:31:20.210
ALBERTO MAESTRO: Makes sense.

00:31:23.300 --> 00:31:26.210
Kubernetes is the foundation
for a lot of these platforms,

00:31:26.210 --> 00:31:31.450
and we're working with our
partners to figure out,

00:31:31.450 --> 00:31:33.200
what is the things
that our customers need

00:31:33.200 --> 00:31:34.200
to be successful?

00:31:34.200 --> 00:31:39.060
So of course, that's our focus--
making customers successful.

00:31:39.060 --> 00:31:40.560
CHEN GOLDBERG: Yes,
and I would say,

00:31:40.560 --> 00:31:43.283
the key thing here is
